Subject: [PATCH] argus: offer an explicit minimal Ubuntu camera build

Keep the complete upstream sample list available. The minimal target contains
the patched camera application and oneshot, without requiring configuration
of unrelated CUDA examples. This is not full Argus sample feature parity.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CompuLab Ubuntu integration]

--- a/argus/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/argus/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -36,6 +36,15 @@
 
 project (ArgusSamples)
 
+option(EDGE_AI_MINIMAL_ARGUS "Build only camera and oneshot" OFF)
+if(EDGE_AI_MINIMAL_ARGUS)
+    add_subdirectory(samples/utils)
+    add_subdirectory(apps/camera)
+    add_subdirectory(samples/oneShot)
+    include(CPack)
+    return()
+endif()
+
 add_subdirectory(apps/camera)
 add_subdirectory(samples/bayerAverageMap)
 add_subdirectory(samples/cudaBayerDemosaic)
